# Logs
# 只忽略仓库根目录的 logs 输出目录；不加前导 / 会连 electron/modules/logs 源码一起忽略，
# 导致新克隆跑不起构建（bootstrap.ts 依赖该模块）
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
dist-electron
*.local
release

# apps (frontend project)
apps/

# Environment
.env
!.env.example

# Local config
.mcp.json
settings.json

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
